\cf0 Developmentally, there are a few things here that are more valuable than the prose:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 The raid should have consequences beyond obtaining the discs.
\f1\b0  This draft correctly notices that stealing Gyges components from wealthy Airborne homes ought to embarrass somebody. The targets were supposedly secure, the attackers were spectacularly conspicuous, and the security architecture proved laughably unsuited to the attack. That could produce bureaucratic panic even if you never dramatise the meeting.\
